# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.  The two patterns below cover local working
# artifacts that must never be pushed.  Both were checked, not assumed:
#
#   *.log   the archived pre-Docker console logs kept in a working copy
#           (r1q2-arena/xatrix-2026-08-03.log, ~600MB together) carry player
#           IP ADDRESSES and player names - 118 and 86 distinct addresses
#           respectively.  That is personal data.  No .log has ever been
#           tracked here.
#   *.html  the review and audit write-ups generated in a working copy.
#           q2-server-review.html quoted the servers' admincode in cleartext
#           while correctly masking rcon_password two lines away, so that was
#           an oversight in the document rather than a decision.
#
# Neither was ever committed - a sweep of all 35 commits found no credential,
# no private key and no public IP in any blob, and no .env, .log, .html or
# CLAUDE.md among the sixteen filenames this repository has ever held.  But
# nothing stopped a `git add .` from changing that, which is what these are for.
*.log
*.html
